<title>USA: Pacific Gas buys Teco pipeline.</title>
<headline>Pacific Gas buys Teco pipeline.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gas Transmission Co, a unit of Pacific Gas and Electric Co, on Wednesday said it will acquire Teco Pipeline Co  for $380 million.</p>
<p>Teco is primarily owned by TRT Holdings Inc of Corpus Christie, Texas, Pacific Gas said. Craig New will remain President of Teco, which will become a subsidiary of Pacific Gas.</p>
<p>Teco owns a 500 mile pipeline system in Texas, and has investments in other gas gatehring and processing facilities. It also owns a gas marketing firm, Pacific Gas said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
